U7: For divide in expanded",**Divide using expanded form like long division (break 339.06 into chunks):** Start with \(339.06\). 1) Take \(300\) (largest part divisible by 5): \[ 300 \div 5 = 60 \] Subtract \(300\) from \(339.06\): \[ 339.06 - 300 = 39.06 \] 2) Take \(35\): \[ 35 \div 5 = 7 \] Subtract: \[ 39.06 - 35 = 4.06 \],Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1854,64,0.000844,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
