eab55134-dbfe-482e-a4fa-ed86c268a4be,2026-08-17T15:18:52.814Z,1,3,"U1: 1. SSS: In ΔABC and ΔPQR, AB = PQ = 5 cm, BC = QR = 6 cm, and AC = PR = 7 cm. Are the triangles congruent Give the criterion. 2. SAS: In ΔABC and ΔDEF, AB = DE = 4 cm, ∠B = ∠E = 60°, and BC = EF = 5 cm. Are the triangles congruent Give the criterion. 3. ASA: In ΔABC and ΔPQR, ∠A = ∠P = 50°, ∠B = ∠Q 
