U3: 30 + bracket of 16 - f / 2 - f",\[ 30 + \left(16 - \frac{f}{2} - f\right) = 30 + 16 - \frac{f}{2} - f = 46 - \frac{f}{2} - f \] Now combine the \(f\)-terms: \[ -\frac{f}{2} - f = -\frac{f}{2} - \frac{2f}{2} = -\frac{3f}{2} \] So the simplified expression is: \[ \boxed{46 - \frac{3f}{2}} \],Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1799,64,0.000822,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
