U2: Please solve this in india style and slove line wise
U3: Which formula you ise","**I used the distributive law (multiplication over addition), also called the FOIL method for two binomials.** For \((a+2)(a-1)\), the idea is: \[ (x+y)(m+n)=x(m+n)+y(m+n)=xm+xn+ym+yn \] So here: \[ (a+2)(a-1)=a(a-1)+2(a-1) \] That’s the “formula” being used (distributive property).",Procedural,,,,,Academic,,,,1802,64,0.000823,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,gate_llm,gate_llm
