U5: explain chapter four round in easy way pronoun",## Pronouns (easy explanation) A **pronoun** is a word that is used **instead of a noun** (a naming word). It helps us avoid repeating the same name again and again. ### Example - **Riya** is my friend. **Riya** is kind. → **Riya** is my friend. **She** is kind. Here **she** is a **pronoun**. --- ##,Conceptual,,,,,Academic,,,,1765,62,0.000805,Skipped full rating by Level-1 gate: gate_llm,1,skip,Academic,Concept Explanation,gate_llm,gate_llm
