A cropped textbook page showing exercises on finding products and simplifying algebraic expressions, including polynomial multiplication problems. Several subproblems are partially cut off at the right edge.","**चित्र में कई सवाल हैं, इसलिए पहले (a) को step-by-step करते हैं।**

\[
(x-y)(x^2+xy+y^2)
\]

हर पद को \(x-y\) से गुणा करें:

\[
x(x^2+xy+y^2)-y(x^2+xy+y^2)
\]

अब विस्तार करें:

\[
= x^3+x^2y+xy^2-x^2y-xy^2-y^3
\]

समान पद कट जाएँगे:

\[
x^2y-x^2y=0,\qquad xy^2-xy^2=0
\]

इसलिए,

\[
\boxed{(x-y)(x^2+xy+y^2)=x^3-y^3}
\]

**(a) का उत्तर: \(\boxed{x^3-y^3}\)**

