\]

दोनों sides का reciprocal ले लो:
\[
\frac{31.8}{1.06}=\frac{622\times M2}{7092}
\]

अब \(7092\) से multiply:
\[
7092\cdot \frac{31.8}{1.06}=622\,M2
\]

अब 622 से divide:
\[
M2=\frac{7092\cdot 31.8}{1.06\cdot 622}
\]

अब calculate:
\[
7092\cdot 31.8=225525.6
\]
\[
1.06\cdot 622=659.32
\]
\[
M2=\frac{225525.6}{659.32}\approx \mathbf{342.06}
\]

तो **\(M2 \approx 342.06\)** (2 d.p. तक)।",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,13423,278,0.003338,"The bot correctly interprets and solves the user's queries, including clarifying the difference between M2 and M2K and recalculating based on corrected formulas. There are no evident failures or misunderstandings, and the user re-asks for clarification but the bot addresses the intent accurately. The user sentiment is neutral with no explicit frustration or complaint.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,same_intent_reask | paraphrase_reask | gate_llm,gate_llm
