**Lekin main tumhe sikhate hue kara dunga—abhi (i)–(iii) kar lete hain, phir tum (iv) try karke bhej do, main check + correct kar dunga.**

**(i)** \((-3x+4)^2\) 
\[
(-3x+4)^2 = (-3x)^2 + 2(-3x)(4) + 4^2 = 9x^2 - 24x + 16
\]
**Answer:** \(\mathbf{9x^2-24x+16}\)

**(ii)** \((2s+7)(2s-7)\) (difference of squares) 
\[
(2s+7)(2s-7) = (2s)^2 - 7^2 = 4s^2 - 49
\]
**Answer:** \(\mathbf{4s^2-49}\)

**(iii)** \(\left(p^2+\frac12\right)\left(p^2-\frac12\right)\) (difference of squares) 
\[
\left(p^2+\frac12\right)\left(p^2-\frac12\right) = (p^2)^2 - \left(\frac12\right)^2
= p^4 - \frac14
\]
**Answer:** \(\mathbf{p^4-\frac14}\)

Ab **(iv)** tum try karo: \((2n+7)(2n-7)\). 
