U4: What is volume of the both tub in litres is volume in cm 3 is 2058","**If each tub has volume \(2058\ \text{cm}^3\):**

\[
2058\ \text{cm}^3 = \frac{2058}{1000}\ \text{L} = 2.058\ \text{L}
