U11: 4","**मैट्रिक्स (Matrices) और डिटरमिनेंट (Determinants) में सबसे ज़रूरी बातें ये हैं:**

**Matrix** = संख्याओं की एक तालिका (rows × columns). 
- **Order**: \(m \times n\) (जैसे 2×3, 3×3) 
- **Types**: 
\( \)• Row matrix \(1\times n\), Column matrix \(m\times1\) 
\( \)• Square matrix \(n\times n\) 
\( \)• Zero matrix (सब 0) 
\( \)• Identity \(I\): diagonal पर 1, बाकी 0 
\( \)• Diagonal / Scalar (diagonal पर same number) 
\( \)• Symmetric: \(A^T = A\) 
\( \)• Skew-symmetric: \(A^T = -A\)

**Basic operations** 
- Addition/Subtraction: same order होना चाहिए 
- Multiplication: \(A_{m\times n} \cdot B_{n\times p}\) possible, result \(m\times p\) 
- Transpose: \((A^T)_{ij} = A_{ji}\)

**Determinant** (सिर्फ square matrices के लिए) 
- \(2\times2\): 
\[
\begin{vmatrix}
a & b\\
c & d
\end{vmatrix}
= ad - bc
\]
- \(3\times3\): cofactors/expansion से

**Determinant के कुछ quick properties** 
- दो rows (या columns) swap ⇒ determinant का sign बदलता है 
- किसी row/column को \(k\) से multiply ⇒ determinant भी \(k\) से multiply 
- दो rows/columns same या proportional ⇒ determinant \(=0\) 
- Triangular matrix ⇒ determinant = diagonal elements का product

**Inverse (अगर \(|A|\neq 0\))** 
\[
A^{-1}=\frac{1}{|A|}\,\text{adj}(A)
\]

अब बताइए: **आप किस चीज़ में अटक रहे हैं?** 
**(a)** determinants की properties, **(b)** inverse निकालना, **(c)** matrix multiplication, या **(d)** linear equations solve करना?",Small Talk,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Image Upload | Slotfill,,,0.9500,15271,308,0.003751,"The bot correctly understood and answered the user's academic queries with detailed explanations and appropriate use of slotfill and image input. There were no failures such as incorrect answers, context loss, or unwanted template pushes. The user showed some implicit uncertainty but did not explicitly reject or complain about the answers or format.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
