0eb3151f-f4ab-4599-873a-62bdcd9b21e3,2026-08-17T15:08:21.810Z,30622272,3,"U1: INFORMAL LETTER WRITING - FORMAT
Grade: 8
Guidelines to write an informal letter:
Name: \( \_\_\_\_ \) me: P
\( \_\_\_\_ \)
- Your letter should be aligned towards the LEFT MARGIN. HA
- The letter should consist use comma after greetings and salutations Body and Conclusion.
- DON'T USE COMMA after greetings and salutations.
- Stick to the word limit.

SAMPLE INFORMAL LETTER
You are Sam/Saasha. You have recently relocated to New Delhi. Write a letter to sibling telling
You are Sam/Saasha. Your experience in the new city.
XYZ Apartments
New Delhi \( \_\_\_\_ \) Sender's address
26 May 2025
\( \_\_\_\_ \) Date
Dear [sibling's name]
\( \_\_\_\_ \) Salutation
I hope this letter finds you well. It feels like ages since we caught up. Things have been pretty hectic around here lately, but I'm finally sitting down to fill you in.
\( \_\_\_\_ \)
First off, I'm excited to tell you that I've started a new job! It's been a bit overwhelming, but also really exciting. I'm working at a small marketing agency, and so far, I'm loving the creativity of it all. My colleagues are great, and I'm learning something new every day. There's still a lot to unpack, but I'm slowly making my new apartment feel like home. The weather hay. There's still a lot to unpack, but I'm slowly bonus. You'll have to come over and see it once ever has been pretty good lately, which is always a joined a yoga class! I've been meaning to get into it for ages. It's such a great way to relax after a busy day.

Body
How's work going for you? I'd love to hear about what you've been upto lately. Do write back when you get the chance. Take care and talk soon!
Warmest regards/ Yours lovingly
Sam/Saasha

