Fire insaan ki **desire aur greed** (zyada chaah, lalach) ka symbol hai. 

2. **Ice kya symbolise karti hai?** 
Ice **hate, jealousy aur cold feelings** ka symbol hai. 

3. **Poet ko duniya ka end fire se kyun possible lagta hai?** 
Kyunki poet ne khud **desire** feel ki hai aur jaanta hai ki zyada desire se destruction ho sakta hai. 

4. **Poet kehte hain “I know enough of hate” – iska kya matlab hai?** 
Poet kehna chahte hain ki unhone **nafrat ko bhi dekha/samjha** hai, isliye unhe pata hai ki hate bhi duniya ko destroy kar sakti hai. 

5. **Poem ka main message kya hai?** 
