U11: Nahin Aaya","**चलिए बिल्कुल आसान तरीके से समझते हैं (15, 270):**

\(270\) को \(15\) से भाग (divide) करके देखते हैं:

- \(15 \times 10 = 150\) 
अब बचा: \(270 - 150 = 120\)
- \(15 \times 8 = 120\) 
अब बचा: \(120 - 120 = 0\)

तो कुल \(15 \times (10+8) = 15 \times 18 = 270\)

क्योंकि **अंत में शेष (remainder) \(0\)** आया, इसलिए

**अंतिम जवाब: \(15\), \(270\) का गुणनखंड (factor) है।**

अगर तुम्हारे सवाल में “HCF/LCM” या “factor है या नहीं” में से कौन सा पूछा है, वो एक बार लिख दो।",NA,4,4,3,7.333333333333333,Academic | Specific Named Resource | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,13965,280,0.003454,"The bot correctly understood and addressed the user's math homework question about factors with step-by-step explanations. Although the user had some difficulty providing input, the bot did not lose context or give incorrect answers. The conversation was clear and polite, with no evident failures or user frustration.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
