### Easy trick: Multiply any number by 9

**Idea:** 
To do \( \text{number} \times 9 \), first do \( \text{number} \times 10 \), then subtract the number.

Example: 
\( 7 \times 9 \) 
- First: \( 7 \times 10 = 70 \) 
- Then: \( 70 - 7 = 63 \) 
So, \( 7 \times 9 = 63 \).

Try this: 
