U4: pura Hindi mein mat batao mujhe Hindi plus English mein","Bilkul, chalo mix Hindi + English mein samajhte hain 🙂 

### 1. Wave nature of light (प्रकाश की तरंग प्रकृति)

Light ko hum **wave (तरंग)** ki tarah bhi maan sakte hain. Is wajah se light ye cheezein dikhाती है:

- **Interference (हस्तक्षेप):** 
Jab do light waves मिलती हैं, तो kabhi brightness बढ़ जाती है (constructive interference) aur kabhi कम हो जाती है (destructive interference). 
- **Diffraction (विवर्तन):** 
Jab light koi chhota सा slit ya obstacle ke किनारे se गुजरती है, to woh **मुड़ जाती है / फैल जाती है**. 

Ye sab tabhi possible है jab light को **wave** माना जाए.

---

### 2. Particle nature of light (प्रकाश की कण प्रकृति)

Light ko **particle** ki तरह bhi माना जाता है. Ye छोटे–छोटे energy packets hote हैं जिन्हें **photons** कहते हैं.

- Har **photon** apne साथ निश्चित **energy** लेकर चलता है. 
- **Photoelectric effect** mein: 
Jab kisi metal surface पर light डाली जाती है, to agar photons ki energy काफी हो, to वे metal se **electrons ko बाहर निकाल** सकते हैं. 

Ye behaviour wave se explain नहीं हो पाता, isliye hum kehte हैं light ki **particle nature** bhi hoti hai.

---

Isko overall bolते हैं: **wave–particle duality of light** 
Yaani light **kabhi wave ki तरह, kabhi particle ki तरह** behave karti hai, situation ke हिसाब से.

Agar chaho to main sirf wave nature ya sirf particle nature ko aur simple examples ke साथ समझा सकता हूँ.",Conceptual,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic | Speech to Text,,,0.9500,12960,262,0.003210,"The bot correctly and comprehensively answered the user's questions about the wave and particle nature of light, including explanations in mixed Hindi and English as requested. There are no evident failures or misunderstandings, and the user did not express frustration or dissatisfaction. The session is fully academic with speech-to-text modality, and the bot maintained context well.",0,full_rate,Academic,Concept Explanation,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
