- **Causes → Events → Results** (this pattern fits many questions).

**4) Geography: focus on scoring areas (15–20 min)**
- **Key terms** (like types, processes, factors).
- **Diagrams/maps:** practice only the **most repeated one** (if your chapters have maps, labelling gives easy marks).

**5) Do a quick self-test (10–15 min)**
