- **Education support for girls:** Programs to increase girls’ enrolment and reduce dropouts (like **Beti Bachao Beti Padhao** and other scholarship/support schemes). 
- **Reservation in local government:** **One-third seats** reserved for women in **Panchayats and Municipalities** to increase women’s participation in politics. 
- **Laws against dowry and domestic cruelty:** **Dowry Prohibition Act (1961)** and **Section 498A IPC** (cruelty by husband/relatives). 
- **Law against domestic violence:** **Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act (2005)**. 
- **Laws against sexual harassment/assault:** **Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace Act (2013)** and stronger legal protections against sexual violence. 
- **Ban on sex selection:** **PCPNDT Act (1994)** to stop sex-selective tests and female foeticide. 
- **Maternity benefits and workplace support:** **Maternity Benefit (Amendment) Act (2017)** to support working mothers. 
