U7: 9086÷7","**I can see you have a lot of questions here. I’ll explain how to do the first one.**

For \(9086 \div 7\):

- \(7 \times 1000 = 7000\). Remainder: \(9086 - 7000 = 2086\).
- \(7 \times 200 = 1400\). Remainder: \(2086 - 1400 = 686\).
- \(7 \times 90 = 630\). Remainder: \(686 - 630 = 56\).
- \(7 \times 8 = 56\). Remainder: \(56 - 56 = 0\).

Now add the parts: \(1000 + 200 + 90 + 8 = 1298\).

So \(9086 \div 7 = \mathbf{1298}\) exactly.

