Words: **soldings, saving, sat, saint**

All start with **s**, so look at the **2nd letter**:
- **sa**… : saving, sat, saint 
- **so**… : soldings (this will come after all the **sa** words)

Now alphabetize the **sa** words by the **3rd letter**:
- **sai**… (saint) has **i**
- **sav**… (saving) has **v**
- **sat**… (sat) has **t**

So among those: **saint** comes first, then compare **sat** vs **saving**: **sat** (t as 3rd letter) comes before **saving** (v as 3rd letter).

