U3: X ki power 2 - 2x - 8","**\(x^2 - 2x - 8\) को factor (गुणनखंड) में तोड़ना है: \(\mathbf{(x-4)(x+2)}\)**

ऐसे सोचो: दो ऐसी संख्याएँ चाहिए जिनका

- गुणनफल \(-8\) हो 
- और जोड़ \(-2\) हो

\(-8\) के pairs: \((1,-8),\,(-1,8),\,(2,-4),\,(-2,4)\)

इनमें **\(2\) और \(-4\)** का जोड़ \(-2\) आता है, इसलिए:

\[
x^2 - 2x - 8 = (x+2)(x-4)
\]

अगर “solve” भी करना है (यानि \(x^2-2x-8=0\)) तो:

\[
(x+2)(x-4)=0 \Rightarrow x=-2 \text{ या } x=4
\]",Procedural,5,5,3,8.666666666666668,Academic,,,0.9500,13313,218,0.003260,"The bot correctly answered the user's math questions with detailed explanations and no errors or failures. There were no indications of user frustration or repeated re-asks, so user sentiment is neutral. The session is fully academic with no modality or flow tags present.",0,full_rate,Academic,Homework / Assignment Help,explicit_frustration | gate_llm,gate_llm
