A handwritten question asking for the principle of electrical energy generation, likely requiring a brief five-mark answer.","**The principle of generation of electrical energy is based on **electromagnetic induction**.**

**When a coil is rotated in a magnetic field, the magnetic flux linked with the coil changes. This change induces an electromotive force (emf) and produces electric current in the coil. The direction of the induced current can be found using Fleming’s right-hand rule.**

